OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells initially. However, it
OL,7,Fwill cloud over from the north after
OL,8,Fmidnight with rain arriving by dawn.
OL,9,FStrengthening southwesterly winds,
OL,10,Fwith a risk coastal gales across
OL,11,FGwynedd and Anglesey later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA band of cloud and rain
OL,14,Falready across north Wales will
OL,15,Fgradually sink south across the
OL,16,Fcountry during the day. Some heavier
OL,17,Fbursts possible. Rather windy, with
OL,18,Ftemperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
